Android: Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, Material 3, MVVM, Coroutines/Flow, Navigation Compose, CameraX, ML Kit Text Recognition, Room, DataStore, managed authentication.

Backend: choose Kotlin/Ktor or Kotlin/Java/Spring Boot; do not maintain both initially.

Infrastructure: PostgreSQL, private object storage, optional Redis, managed job queue when needed, FCM, CI/CD, structured logs, metrics, tracing, error reporting and managed backups.
